 ## [Unreleased]
 
+## [0.4.0] - 2026-10-22
+
+### Added
+
+- Tool input validation against `inputSchema`. `ToolRegistry.register` now compiles the declared
+  JSON Schema and throws at registration time if it is invalid. `execute` validates the AI
+  provider's input against the schema, returning a rejection to the model instead of throwing.
+  Executors now receive only input that has passed validation; unknown keys (not listed in the
+  schema) are still passed through to support forward compatibility.
+
